      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please add this!! VRC is one of the hardest VR games to run, if not the hardest VR game to run. Filled with a dedicated core of players who spend a lot to get top of the line kits to make the experience as good as possible, lots of people would benefit from foveated rendering. Eye tracking is already supported! Out of any game, this one needs optimization features most of all.",
