      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a related performance feature: a solid integration of NVIDIA DLSS and AMD FSR would also make a lot of sense alongside DFR. Looking forward, more gains will come from upscaling and frame generation rather than purely increasing native rendering performance.",
