      "value": "@{5a33f59b7f2ea83fad4a5ecd|full_name}\n\nI hear you, but there are a lot of situations that are GPU bottlenecked rather than CPU bottlenecked. Usually you need better CPU performance when you're dealing with a lot of avatars in an instance, but there are worlds that are very taxing as well.\n\nI have a 9070xt and my home world runs at 60-70fps with my GPU maxed out. Not bad by any means, until you consider that I'm the only one there. There are other taxing cool hangout worlds I'd like to be more comfortable in spending time with.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
